From: Robin Lintermann <rl@karo-electronics.de>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 08:44:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add Karo wic source plugins with partition tar export

- Add 'karo_rootfs' and 'karo_bootimg_partition' source plugins that
  extend the standard rootfs/bootimg-partition plugins and export each
  partition's content as tar archives
- Add src/wic/tarhelp.py with shared tar export helpers
- Export archives for the tar.* entries in IMAGE_FSTYPES
  (tar.bz2, tar.gz, tar.xz, tar.zst); compression is selected by the
  archive suffix via 'tar -a'
- Deploy archives to IMGDEPLOYDIR as
  ${IMAGE_BASENAME}-${MACHINE}.<partition-label>.tar.<ending>
- Note: IMAGE_FSTYPES must be added to WICVARS for the wic run to see it

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [karo-specific]

